        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>So my freind and I just did OblivAeon for the first time (we lost but at least Nixious was eaten by Raptors so it was worth it) and during the fight Wraith Throat Jabbed Bor the Unstable.&nbsp; Before her next turn came about he exploded but he still did damage as if he wasn't throat jabbed.&nbsp; Now normally I'd send a bug report but this might just be the rules so I figured I'd ask first.</p>",
