      {
        "id": 227846,
        "name": "FearLord",
        "username": "FearLord",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/5f8ce5/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-24T06:58:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think that’s how it works - once he flips, he’s no longer a target so damage reducing effects that were placed on his front side don’t affect the damage he does.</p>",
